  "interpretation": "The V4 action recovered in Audit 014 produces fifteen orbits of four G60 states. Quotienting native G60 by those orbits gives a connected four-regular graph with fifteen vertices and thirty edges. Every quotient edge has exactly four G60 lifts. Its ten triangles reconstruct a cubic ten-vertex root graph, and the quotient is exactly the line graph of that root. An explicit graph isomorphism identifies the root with the standard Petersen graph.",
  "keeper": "The lawful order-three transport set determines its V4 deck symmetry, and that symmetry hides exactly the Petersen line graph beneath G60.",
